</table>

<h3 id="river-system">River system</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> A river plus all its tributaries plus the surrounding land it drains. Operates as a connected system.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A branching tree of streams flowing into one main river.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "The Cauvery river system spans Karnataka, Tamil Nadu, Kerala, and Puducherry."</p>
