</table>

<h3 id="coastal-landform">Coastal landform</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> Features formed where land meets sea: beaches, cliffs, bars, lagoons, estuaries.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> Cross-section of a coast showing beach, dune, cliff.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Pulicat Lake is a bar-built lagoon, a specific coastal landform."</p>
