</table>

<h3 id="geomorphology">Geomorphology</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> The scientific study of landscape forms and the processes that shape them.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A textbook with diagrams of valleys, mountains, river systems.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Geomorphology helps us read landscapes, to understand the processes that made what we see."</p>
