</table>

<h3 id="substrate">Substrate</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> The underlying material of a landscape, the bedrock or soil that everything else sits on.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> Cross-section showing soil + sediment + bedrock layers.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Pallikaranai Marsh sits on Holocene coastal alluvium, a young substrate that makes it wet + soft."</p>
