</table>

<h3 id="bedrock">Bedrock</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> Solid rock underlying soil and sediment. The deep, stable foundation of a landscape.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> Dark, solid rock at the bottom of a soil profile.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "The Eastern Ghats foothills are exposed Precambrian bedrock, among the oldest rocks in South India."</p>
