</table>

<h3 id="topography">Topography</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> The shape of the land, elevation, slope, valleys, hills, plains.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A contour map.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Chennai's topography is mostly low and flat near the coast, with the Eastern Ghats rising to the west."</p>
