<h3 id="outcrop">Outcrop</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> A place where bedrock is exposed at the surface, not hidden under soil or vegetation.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A rocky cliff face exposed above soil.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Mahabalipuram's coastal outcrops are where Pallava-era artisans carved the rock-cut temples."</p>
