</table>

<h3 id="restoration-ecological">Restoration (ecological)</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> Bringing back ecological function to a degraded landscape, restoring wetlands, replanting forests, recovering biodiversity.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> Before/after photo: degraded land → restored wetland.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "The Adyar Estuary restoration project has been more successful than the Cooum restoration so far."</p>
