</table>

<h3 id="volcanism">Volcanism</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> Volcanic activity, magma rising and erupting at the surface. Different volcanoes produce different eruption types.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> Cross-section of a volcano with magma chamber.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Pinatubo's 1991 eruption was a major volcanism event that affected global climate for years."</p>
