</table>

<h3 id="lahar">Lahar</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> A volcanic mudflow, water mixed with volcanic ash and rock, that can flow long distances down valleys.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A thick gray mud flow racing down a valley.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Merapi lahars contaminated water supplies and destroyed villages downstream for years."</p>
