</table>

<h3 id="engineering-design">Engineering design</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> The systematic process of designing solutions to problems under constraints (budget, materials, safety).</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> An engineer at a desk with sketches + calculations + a planned structure.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Engineering design for the Tectonic City Builder requires balancing budget against multiple hazards."</p>
