</table>

<h3 id="hazard">Hazard</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> A natural process that has potential to harm people or property, earthquake, tsunami, volcanic eruption, flood, drought.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> Warning sign with various icons (earthquake, tsunami, fire).</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Subduction zones have multiple compounding hazards: megathrust earthquake + tsunami + liquefaction."</p>
