</table>

<h3 id="resilience">Resilience</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> Ability of a system (city, ecosystem, building) to absorb shock and recover. Not the same as resistance (preventing damage).</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A bouncy ball deformed by impact, then springing back.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Building resilience matters as much as building resistance, even strong cities will face some disaster damage."</p>
