</table>

<h3 id="simulation">Simulation</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> A computer model that allows testing of decisions without real-world consequences. The Tectonic City Builder is a simulation.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A computer screen showing a city model with disaster effects.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Simulation lets students iterate engineering decisions and see consequences immediately."</p>
