</table>

<h3 id="mitigation">Mitigation</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> Reducing greenhouse gas emissions to limit how much climate change happens (renewable energy, efficiency, reforestation).</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> Solar panels + wind turbines + forest.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Mitigation matters globally; even with full mitigation, some adaptation is still needed."</p>
