</table>

<h3 id="policy-brief">Policy brief</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> A short document (~4 pages) explaining a problem to policymakers and recommending specific actions. Uses non-academic, decision-focused voice.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A 4-page document with executive summary, problem, evidence, recommendations sections.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "The Chennai Climate Brief is your policy brief addressed to the Greater Chennai Corporation."</p>
