</table>

<h3 id="scenario">Scenario</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> A possible future, based on specific assumptions. IPCC scenarios (SSPs) explore different emissions + policy pathways. Not predictions.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> Branching paths labeled SSP1-1.9, SSP2-4.5, etc.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "The SSP5-8.5 scenario is the worst-case high-emissions pathway; SSP1-1.9 is the most aggressive mitigation pathway."</p>
