</table>

<h3 id="projection">Projection</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> An estimate of future conditions based on current trends and assumptions. Not a prediction: depends on what choices we make.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A graph showing different future temperature lines based on different assumed actions.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Climate projections show 1.5–3°C warming by 2100 depending on how quickly we mitigate."</p>
