</table>

<h3 id="ipcc">IPCC</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change. UN body that synthesizes global climate science. AR6 is the most recent assessment (2021–2023).</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> UN logo + climate report covers.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "IPCC AR6 confirms human responsibility for most warming since 1850 with virtual certainty."</p>
