<h3 id="tipping-point">Tipping point</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> A threshold beyond which a system shifts to a different state, often hard or impossible to reverse. (Arctic ice loss, Amazon dieback, AMOC slowdown.)</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A ball rolling along a flat surface, then suddenly dropping over an edge.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Crossing a tipping point in the Amazon would shift the rainforest to savanna, a likely permanent change."</p>
