</table>

<h3 id="vulnerability">Vulnerability</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> The degree to which a system is exposed to climate impacts AND lacks capacity to cope with them.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A house in a flood zone + an elderly resident without AC = high vulnerability.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Chennai's low-income coastal residents face high vulnerability to combined heat + flood + sea-level rise."</p>
