</table>

<h3 id="anthropogenic">Anthropogenic</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> Caused by human activity. Anthropogenic climate change = caused by human emissions, not natural variation.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> Human hand turning a thermostat dial.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Recent warming is overwhelmingly anthropogenic, natural variation alone cannot explain it."</p>
