</table>

<h2 id="u5">Unit 5: Hydrosphere, Freshwater &amp; Ocean Systems <span class="quiet-small quiet-regular">(12 terms)</span></h2>

<h3 id="hydrosphere">Hydrosphere</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> All the water on, under, and above Earth's surface, oceans, lakes, rivers, groundwater, atmosphere, ice.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> Earth with oceans + clouds + rivers + ice highlighted.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "The hydrosphere is one of Earth's four major subsystems."</p>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Tamil</th><th>Hindi</th><th>Français</th><th>Korean</th><th>Japanese</th></tr></thead>
