<h3 id="stakeholder">Stakeholder</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> Any person or group with an interest in a decision or outcome. In water disputes: farmers, governments, communities, ecosystems.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> Multiple people standing around a table marked "water rights."</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "The Cauvery dispute has at least 7 major stakeholder groups with different interests."</p>
