</table>

<h3 id="water-rights">Water rights</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> Legal entitlements to use water from a shared source. Frameworks vary: riparian rights (geographic), prior appropriation (first-come), tribal/indigenous rights.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A river with multiple users and lines defining who can take how much.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Water rights for the Cauvery are defined by Tribunal awards + Supreme Court rulings."</p>
