</table>

<h3 id="riparian">Riparian</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> Relating to a river bank or the land near a river. Riparian zones are ecologically important and often legally protected.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A river with green vegetation along its banks.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Healthy riparian zones reduce flood damage and support biodiversity."</p>
