</table>

<h3 id="allocation">Allocation</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> Dividing a limited resource (water, energy, land) among different uses or users. Often contested + political.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A pie chart of water divided among agriculture, cities, industry, environment.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Cauvery allocation is politically contested between Tamil Nadu + Karnataka."</p>
