</table>

<h3 id="conjunctive-use">Conjunctive use</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> Coordinated use of surface water and groundwater together for maximum sustainable yield.</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A diagram showing pumping from groundwater + drawing from a reservoir in coordination.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Conjunctive use is more sustainable than reliance on either surface or groundwater alone."</p>
