</table>

<h3 id="demand">Demand</h3>
<p><strong>Definition:</strong> How much energy people want, at what time. Demand varies daily, seasonally, by sector (residential / commercial / industrial / transport).</p>
<p><strong>Visual cue:</strong> A demand graph: low at night, peaking in afternoon, varying by season.</p>
<p><strong>In a sentence:</strong> "Phoenix's peak demand is in summer afternoons when AC use peaks."</p>
